  CellName: Starweave
  Description: 'Crossfire - intensity 3 of Starweave: 10 crystals and every hull at Space 3 - the guns
    reach further, a weave must be guarded. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392
    u), no environment, no flora and no fauna - the arena is what the Brittle Stars weave
    into it. StarweaveController scatters the elemental crystals; 3 omni crystals respawn
    inside the nucleus (the scene''s CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the most four
    pilots can weave (6,750 blocks, 162,000 volume). Authored by
    Tools/Build/author_starweave_assets.py - re-run it rather than hand-editing.'
